WEBVTT

00:04.560 --> 00:05.960
Vitamin C...

00:05.960 --> 00:08.320
Why did you betray me?

00:20.620 --> 00:22.600
We've come quite a way now.

00:22.600 --> 00:24.460
It's all right. We're almost there.

00:24.460 --> 00:25.370
But...

00:27.150 --> 00:30.900
Nee-sama, the truth is a monster is living in this forest.

00:30.900 --> 00:31.820
A monster?

00:31.820 --> 00:32.460
Yes.

00:32.460 --> 00:34.610
Cold, black eyes...

00:34.610 --> 00:37.190
Shining fangs in a bloody mouth...

00:37.790 --> 00:39.160
Savagely built body...

00:39.460 --> 00:40.900
Senko-chan?

00:40.900 --> 00:47.330
The monster is waiting to eat those fools who carelessly step into the forest.

00:47.330 --> 00:49.360
Like beyond those bushes.

00:50.610 --> 00:52.740
Or behind those trees.

00:52.740 --> 00:52.740
No!

00:56.750 --> 00:58.390
I'm joking, Nee-sama.

00:58.390 --> 01:00.280
No monster lives here.

01:00.280 --> 01:02.840
Only my adorable friend.

01:02.840 --> 01:03.790
Friend?

01:04.160 --> 01:05.280
Vitamin C.

01:05.590 --> 01:06.870
Vitamin C?

01:06.870 --> 01:09.340
Yes. Vitamin C.

02:33.080 --> 02:37.260
The maidens who assemble in Gojyu Hissatsu Academy today, too, go over high hurdles with smiles on their faces.

02:37.260 --> 02:38.510
The pleats on their skirts should never rip.

02:38.510 --> 02:40.260
No weapons should peek out of their sailor collars.

02:40.260 --> 02:41.360
First hit wins! One-hit kills!

02:41.360 --> 02:43.610
Hitting before being hit is preferred here.

03:00.580 --> 03:01.360
Ow!

03:04.970 --> 03:07.680
Don't be so mad with me. I'm sorry.

03:19.180 --> 03:21.550
You left really early today, Nee-sama.

03:21.550 --> 03:25.770
I heard you were meeting at nine,
so I was simply surprised not to see you when I got up.

03:25.770 --> 03:28.220
Yeah, my eyes just opened.

03:28.220 --> 03:30.150
You must have been looking forward to it.

03:30.150 --> 03:31.100
Not really.

03:31.100 --> 03:34.970
Hi-chan moved, so she just asked if we'd like to go visit, that's all.

03:36.230 --> 03:37.840
Ah, Hijiri-san.

03:38.430 --> 03:39.790
"Hi-chan", huh?

03:39.790 --> 03:40.900
What?

03:41.720 --> 03:42.780
Nothing.

03:42.780 --> 03:44.620
You'll be coming home late today, right?

03:44.620 --> 03:46.760
No, I won't!

03:46.180 --> 03:49.490
I'll tell Mom that you simply won't need dinner tonight.

03:49.490 --> 03:51.190
Hey, Yuuka-chan?!

03:51.190 --> 03:52.120
Guess who?

03:54.780 --> 03:55.570
Hi-chan.

03:55.570 --> 03:57.690
Bingo, Onee-sama.

03:59.120 --> 04:03.450
What? What? Why are you looking at me with such a serious face?

04:03.450 --> 04:04.910
Is this Chika's fashion check?

04:04.910 --> 04:06.360
Evaluating me?

04:06.360 --> 04:08.860
Or are you in love with me?

04:08.860 --> 04:11.560
Why would I be? I was just surprised.

04:11.560 --> 04:15.040
Why not? Let's enjoy love. We're maidens.

04:15.040 --> 04:17.270
Maidens don't fall in love with maidens.

04:17.270 --> 04:20.340
On another note, it's rare that you're early.

04:20.340 --> 04:28.140
Well, I love to sleep until the afternoon on weekends, but Kiyoshi-kun pranked me by setting my alarm a whole hour early.

04:28.140 --> 04:31.720
I tortured him good, but I didn't have the time to go back to sleep,

04:31.720 --> 04:35.340
so here I am, after I walked myself over with sleepy eyes.

04:35.340 --> 04:37.230
Toppin pararin pu~

04:37.230 --> 04:39.340
What was that sound supposed to be?

04:41.210 --> 04:42.410
Morning.

04:42.410 --> 04:43.190
Momokusa-san.

04:43.190 --> 04:47.700
Momo-san. You are a girl, so you shouldn't open your mouth so wide when you yawn.

04:47.700 --> 04:53.720
Why not? If you care about guys that, girls that, then you won't be able to see the big picture.

04:53.730 --> 04:57.150
You need to be more attentive to the details.

04:57.150 --> 05:00.340
Wow, how rare. I'm the last one?

05:00.340 --> 05:01.970
You're late, Shizu-chan.

05:01.970 --> 05:04.650
I'm sorry. The train was a little crowded.

05:04.650 --> 05:06.570
How does that explain being late?

05:07.070 --> 05:09.490
Let's not worry about the details.

05:09.490 --> 05:14.240
If you're caught up in the details,
you won't be able to see the big picture.

05:15.050 --> 05:16.290
You were listening, weren't you?

05:16.290 --> 05:17.510
Was is too obvious?

05:17.510 --> 05:20.580
Okay! Now that we're all here, let's go!

05:20.580 --> 05:23.090
Wait, I need to buy a ticket.

05:24.090 --> 05:27.120
I'm still not used to standing under the sun.

05:27.930 --> 05:28.970
But strange.

05:30.570 --> 05:35.760
They all live in different towns,
yet they wanted to meet in my town.

05:37.080 --> 05:38.550
Hurry up, Shizuka.

05:38.550 --> 05:39.480
Get a move on.

05:43.750 --> 05:46.310
I was born to a family called Himemiya.

05:51.870 --> 05:57.500
The family of Oni that flourished by eradicating others and selling off what was left, using love and friendship to their advantage.

06:00.330 --> 06:04.370
Anyone born to the Himemiya used
their family as a tool for relaxation.

06:04.720 --> 06:08.430
It was our destiny to be hurt and tormented as the Solitude Dolls.

06:09.340 --> 06:15.220
A negative spiral of the oldest sister tormenting
the younger, and the younger tormenting the youngest.

06:16.390 --> 06:17.110
But...

06:20.020 --> 06:22.200
She didn't do anything.

06:22.650 --> 06:25.900
She was always kind and wouldn't do anything to me.

06:27.450 --> 06:28.860
That's why I feared her.

06:29.330 --> 06:31.330
I was always afraid that she was plotting something!

06:31.330 --> 06:33.560
That she'd carry out whatever
it was she was plotting one day!

06:38.200 --> 06:40.590
That's when I met him.

07:01.140 --> 07:04.290
No!!!

07:04.930 --> 07:06.270
I met that monster.

07:06.270 --> 07:07.480
Onee-sama!

07:07.480 --> 07:09.320
Onee-sama, help me!

07:09.320 --> 07:12.240
I'm just saying lend me some cash.

07:12.240 --> 07:14.740
Why do we have to lend money to a total stranger?

07:15.500 --> 07:18.320
Hey! Trying to rip off my friend?
You've got some nerve to do that.

07:18.320 --> 07:19.570
What group are you from?

07:19.570 --> 07:21.140
What the hell are you?

07:21.140 --> 07:22.100
Momokusa-san...

07:22.100 --> 07:24.210
Where does she hide that?

07:24.210 --> 07:27.000
What should we do? It'll be bad if she causes a scene.

07:27.000 --> 07:29.290
I even have lunch ready.

07:30.360 --> 07:31.300
I guess you're right.

07:31.300 --> 07:33.170
What, are you up for a fight?

07:33.170 --> 07:37.450
Sure, bring it on. Momokusa group's Momokusa Aichi will take you on!

07:37.450 --> 07:38.170
Wait.

07:39.040 --> 07:39.930
Boss.

07:40.550 --> 07:43.210
I keep telling you to stop calling me that.

07:43.210 --> 07:44.750
Who are you?!

07:45.150 --> 07:48.320
We're in a hurry. Will you let us through?

07:48.320 --> 07:49.390
What?

07:49.390 --> 07:50.540
You will, won't you?

07:57.720 --> 07:59.290
You will, right?

08:03.580 --> 08:04.940
Let's go.

08:05.700 --> 08:06.870
That's our Onee-sama.

08:06.870 --> 08:08.640
We'll follow you forever, Boss.

08:09.350 --> 08:11.630
I said stop calling me that.

08:15.210 --> 08:17.300
Those were Sorabone City guards.

08:26.400 --> 08:28.950
The train's going to come soon, Onee-sama!

08:29.810 --> 08:31.900
Sorry! I'm coming right now.

08:32.640 --> 08:34.760
The monster belonged only to me.

08:39.590 --> 08:42.070
So he's your favorite?

08:42.070 --> 08:43.770
I always see you with him.

08:52.540 --> 08:56.030
My monster who lived alone at the end of a dark forest.

08:56.420 --> 09:03.270
A loser at the bottom of the power pyramid that ends
its life by getting oppressed by the stronger, just like me.

09:10.940 --> 09:13.450
Have some. It'll make you feel better.

09:14.790 --> 09:18.160
You're weak, cowardly, and very unreliable,

09:18.610 --> 09:23.120
but I like one aspect of you, how you listen to what I say without making fun of me.

09:25.290 --> 09:29.340
Let's talk more. Just like A Thousand and One Nights.

09:29.900 --> 09:31.910
But to do that, you need a name.

09:33.510 --> 09:34.780
Vitamin C...

09:35.630 --> 09:37.800
How's that? Isn't it a nice name?

09:44.060 --> 09:46.020
Tear it apart, Vitamin C.

09:48.190 --> 09:49.980
I said tear it apart, Vitamin C!

09:58.600 --> 09:59.820
What's wrong?

10:00.620 --> 10:02.240
I-It's nothing.

10:02.870 --> 10:04.910
Please talk to us, Onee-sama.

10:05.330 --> 10:08.250
You keep everything to yourself too much, Chika-chan.

10:08.250 --> 10:09.370
Y-You think so?

10:09.370 --> 10:10.560
Yes, you do!

10:10.960 --> 10:15.540
If you're troubled by something,
I think you have the right to ask for help.

10:15.540 --> 10:20.070
Sure. Me, Hijiri, and Momokusa-san are all not as reliable as you.

10:21.270 --> 10:24.230
Six eyes see more than two, right?

10:25.580 --> 10:26.510
Thank you.

10:26.510 --> 10:27.730
Was I acting that strangely?

10:28.770 --> 10:31.450
No, no. You didn't look that different from usual.

10:31.450 --> 10:37.560
But at the zoo, strong animals like lions, elephants, and rhinoceroses want to go somewhere but can't,

10:37.560 --> 10:40.000
and it's difficult to catch the abnormality in them.

10:41.000 --> 10:43.580
So I'm a lion in your mind?

10:43.580 --> 10:45.050
Yes, you are!

10:45.050 --> 10:47.750
Especially today. I smell a beast's scent from you.

10:48.120 --> 10:49.140
A beast's scent?

10:49.140 --> 10:49.910
Teika?

10:49.910 --> 10:51.640
It's just a hunch.

10:51.960 --> 10:55.210
It's probably me becoming able to catch small changes.

10:56.440 --> 10:57.420
Since we're friends.

11:03.480 --> 11:05.980
I was remembering an old friend of mine.

11:06.370 --> 11:07.350
An old friend?

11:18.830 --> 11:20.110
No, that's not true.

11:21.220 --> 11:23.600
That wasn't a friendship.

11:23.940 --> 11:24.570
I don't think.

11:28.800 --> 11:29.510
No way!

11:29.510 --> 11:30.370
Onee-sama?!

11:33.960 --> 11:34.630
Vitamin C?

11:34.630 --> 11:35.290
Why?

11:36.710 --> 11:40.260
And I was planning to eat with her.

11:43.710 --> 11:45.170
There's nothing in it?

11:45.710 --> 11:50.290
Of course you're fine, since you're my Vitamin C.

11:55.340 --> 11:58.030
Hey, Vitamin C. I have a favor to ask.

12:01.010 --> 12:02.610
Can you kill that woman?

12:14.840 --> 12:17.930
Onee-sama. It's really fun to see the view from the front.

12:18.710 --> 12:19.380
Ow.

12:37.680 --> 12:38.650
For a walk?

12:40.470 --> 12:44.060
Yes. I found a beautiful place in the forest.

12:44.060 --> 12:45.860
Really? That's nice.

12:50.650 --> 12:55.750
Vitamin C. Who do you think is letting you live?

12:56.780 --> 13:01.030
You were half-dead from hunger and thirst, and couldn't even walk.

13:01.420 --> 13:06.550
You couldn't make any noise at first,
looked so pale, and were scared of the slightest noise.

13:08.350 --> 13:09.140
Hey.

13:12.350 --> 13:14.810
Time for you to return the favor, Vitamin C.

13:16.780 --> 13:17.730
What is this place?

13:17.730 --> 13:21.640
Nee-sama. You never hurt me or curse me.

13:22.650 --> 13:25.820
I was supposed to be the Solitude Doll! Your doll!

13:25.820 --> 13:29.160
I was your doll who you could step on, slap, or hurt! Why didn't you?!

13:30.660 --> 13:33.310
What are you plotting? What are you trying to accomplish?!

13:33.310 --> 13:35.310
Are you having fun watching my reactions?!

13:35.310 --> 13:38.110
Are you trying to make me suffer in despair by entertaining me?!

13:38.110 --> 13:38.670
Or what?!

13:38.670 --> 13:40.500
No, I never thought of anything like that.

13:40.500 --> 13:42.450
It's fine! Forget it already!

13:42.450 --> 13:44.510
Come out, Vitamin C!

13:44.960 --> 13:47.710
It's this woman! Kill this woman!

13:47.150 --> 13:48.300
Senko-chan?

13:48.300 --> 13:49.550
I said come out!

13:49.550 --> 13:51.440
Come out!!!

13:54.240 --> 13:56.400
Vitamin C never came out.

14:00.890 --> 14:02.610
He betrayed me.

14:03.800 --> 14:04.810
Onee-sama?

14:06.500 --> 14:08.500
What's the troubled look on your face?

14:08.500 --> 14:10.400
I-It's nothing.

14:10.400 --> 14:12.100
Just a little light-headed.

14:12.760 --> 14:15.020
Where are the energy drinks?

14:15.460 --> 14:16.820
They'd be over there.

14:17.190 --> 14:18.540
Th-Thank you.

14:18.540 --> 14:20.710
Why can't I get the chocolate?!

14:20.710 --> 14:22.430
It's the king of all snacks!

14:22.430 --> 14:25.250
Gets rid of stress. Sweet. Tastes good. What more can you ask for?!

14:25.250 --> 14:28.520
Chocolate is not a snack. Like cigarettes and alcohol, it's a luxury item.

14:28.520 --> 14:29.950
It's addictive.

14:29.950 --> 14:31.050
Makes you fat, too.

14:31.050 --> 14:32.050
I don't care if I get fat!

14:32.050 --> 14:35.020
We're at an all-girl school, so it's not like we have guys around us all the time.

14:36.240 --> 14:38.470
Unless, do you have a guy around you?

14:39.140 --> 14:42.370
N-No, I don't. I don't have anyone I'm seeing.

14:42.370 --> 14:44.380
You're acting strange.

14:44.380 --> 14:46.620
Oh. Is it Takahaka?!

14:46.620 --> 14:50.210
He wouldn't quit the zoo even after the animalization thing ended, so I was wondering about that.

14:50.210 --> 14:52.540
Ta-Ta-Ta-Takahaka-san's got nothing to do with this!

14:57.580 --> 14:59.990
Wouldn't this be better than the drink type?

15:00.870 --> 15:03.230
Vitamin C saves the day when you're not feeling well.

15:03.230 --> 15:05.870
Works against fevers and even makes your skin smooth.

15:05.870 --> 15:07.630
I-I see.

15:07.630 --> 15:12.760
The reason I never get sick in winter is from eating lots of oranges and supplying lots of vitamin C to my body.

15:14.760 --> 15:16.490
What's the matter, Onee-sama?

15:17.240 --> 15:20.140
Were you thinking of another vitamin C?

15:20.140 --> 15:22.400
No, I wasn't.

15:23.420 --> 15:24.940
Thank you very much.

15:24.940 --> 15:26.880
Time to eat!

15:26.880 --> 15:29.110
Let's wait until we get to Hijiri's place.

15:30.560 --> 15:32.160
Something's wrong.

15:35.060 --> 15:36.830
Why did Vitamin C...

15:37.990 --> 15:42.390
Let's talk more. Just like A Thousand and One Nights.

15:42.820 --> 15:44.820
But to do that, you need a name.

15:46.390 --> 15:47.690
Vitamin C...

15:48.560 --> 15:50.800
How's that? Isn't it a nice name?

15:50.800 --> 15:53.770
Were you thinking of another Vitamin C?

15:55.470 --> 15:57.110
Another Vitamin C?

16:00.820 --> 16:01.750
Hello?

16:01.750 --> 16:03.310
You're all so mean!

16:03.310 --> 16:06.400
I know I overslept and am late by forty minutes!

16:06.400 --> 16:10.780
But you could have been wasting time somewhere or let me know that you'd gone ahead!

16:12.200 --> 16:15.660
Were you thinking of another Vitamin C?

16:18.950 --> 16:22.000
Hi-chan! Who exactly are you?!

16:28.590 --> 16:29.830
Onee-sama!

16:30.410 --> 16:32.060
You idiot! It hit a civilian!

16:32.060 --> 16:33.760
But the signal's coming from that girl.

16:33.760 --> 16:35.430
It's the girl next to her!

16:35.430 --> 16:38.100
Hello? I just heard a loud sound.

16:38.100 --> 16:38.810
Is everything all right there?

16:38.810 --> 16:40.200
Hello?

16:41.270 --> 16:42.430
Onee-sama!

16:42.430 --> 16:43.840
What's Hi-chan doing?

16:50.530 --> 16:51.700
Hijiri!

16:51.700 --> 16:52.780
Is she turning into an animal?

16:52.780 --> 16:54.060
No, I don't think that's quite right.

17:02.120 --> 17:03.250
Vitamin C...

17:05.330 --> 17:06.280
Get out of here!

17:09.020 --> 17:10.090
What is this about?

17:10.090 --> 17:14.100
You think you'll get away for shooting at an innocent high school girl's head?

17:14.100 --> 17:16.470
I'm sorry. I'll properly apologize later.

17:16.840 --> 17:18.010
And what is that?

17:21.140 --> 17:22.310
A Muma.

17:22.310 --> 17:23.020
Muma?

17:23.540 --> 17:27.700
Yeah. It's actually a small animal about the size of a fist.

17:27.700 --> 17:30.960
It, itself, is weak and not too dangerous.

17:30.960 --> 17:34.600
However when bitten by a Muma,
humans get their memory controlled.

17:34.600 --> 17:42.240
It scans a nightmare or a childhood trauma the person had and materializes it.

17:43.640 --> 17:45.870
I figured it was something like that.

17:47.510 --> 17:49.310
Momo-san, can I borrow your bat?

17:50.310 --> 17:51.580
Boss, but...

17:52.150 --> 17:53.560
That's my nightmare.

17:53.560 --> 17:54.810
I'll put an end to it.

17:54.810 --> 17:58.280
Wait! You can't kill a monster born from a Muma.

17:58.280 --> 18:00.790
You have to kill the Muma who created it.

18:00.790 --> 18:03.790
Don't worry. Vitamin C's my slave.

18:05.760 --> 18:07.740
Call the real Hi-chan.

18:07.740 --> 18:12.980
The hamster in the pet shop in front of the train station is the Muma, so tell her to capture it and be sure not to get bitten.

18:17.690 --> 18:19.490
Long time no see, Vitamin C.

18:22.770 --> 18:24.690
You're a coward as you've always been.

18:31.010 --> 18:32.590
No matter how large you make yourself appear...

18:32.590 --> 18:35.190
No matter how scary you make yourself appear, I'm fine!

18:35.190 --> 18:36.250
You don't frighten me at all!

18:37.780 --> 18:38.970
Since you...

18:40.090 --> 18:40.840
You...

18:48.770 --> 18:50.770
You were never a monster.

18:58.670 --> 19:00.780
You were never a monster.

19:00.780 --> 19:03.830
You were an escapee from some jail!

19:03.830 --> 19:06.450
But you were still my friend.

19:06.450 --> 19:10.120
You were a monster that would listen to me and had a chance of helping me.

19:12.460 --> 19:15.670
And yet, why were you so weak?!

19:15.670 --> 19:19.480
I took care of you, yet why did you betray me?!

19:23.930 --> 19:26.470
I wanted you to take the responsibility of killing my sister!

19:27.310 --> 19:30.040
You ungrateful, coward Vitamin C!

19:30.040 --> 19:32.810
If you would have killed my sister...

19:32.810 --> 19:35.830
If you would have listened to my wish and killed my sister...

19:35.830 --> 19:37.980
Then I... I...

19:41.500 --> 19:43.870
I would have been stuck in the dark forever.

19:44.700 --> 19:48.150
I would have become a real Oni and lurked in the dark forever.

19:55.370 --> 19:58.430
Maybe it was that you were too afraid to come out.

19:58.740 --> 20:00.840
Maybe you really ran away.

20:00.840 --> 20:03.210
But you didn't kill my sister.

20:03.640 --> 20:05.300
So I am as I am here, today.

20:07.470 --> 20:10.390
In a warm place where I can bask in the sun.

20:12.880 --> 20:15.880
You're free now, Vitamin C.

20:15.880 --> 20:21.070
No matter what you do, where you do it, or if you don't listen to me, I'm fine now.

20:21.070 --> 20:23.440
Now, go on, Vitamin C.

20:37.160 --> 20:38.750
Did you hand it over to the guards?

20:38.750 --> 20:41.350
Yeah, it's all right now.

20:41.350 --> 20:42.950
We're all fine, including Onee-sama.

20:42.950 --> 20:43.540
Ow.

20:58.140 --> 21:01.780
Something that interesting happened without me knowing?

21:01.780 --> 21:03.360
It's not interesting at all.

21:03.360 --> 21:05.100
I got hit in the face by a rubber bullet.

21:05.100 --> 21:09.460
I'm so jealous! I always get left out of the fun.

21:09.460 --> 21:12.000
Both the animalization thing and the alien case.

21:12.320 --> 21:14.660
I think it's better for you stay out of it.

21:15.620 --> 21:17.370
We're out of snacks already?

21:17.370 --> 21:19.260
It's because you went ahead and ate them all.

21:19.860 --> 21:23.130
Dad said he'd go buy some more, so I'll go get them.

21:23.680 --> 21:25.250
Can I use the bathroom?

21:37.600 --> 21:40.360
Hijiri, are these good enough?

21:40.360 --> 21:42.110
Oh, I'm sorry.

21:44.740 --> 21:47.670
You're Hijiri's friend, right?

21:48.360 --> 21:49.640
Y-Yes.

21:49.620 --> 21:51.420
You're...

21:51.420 --> 21:52.370
Yes!

21:54.130 --> 21:56.740
Nice to meet you. I'm Midarezaki Chika.

22:00.270 --> 22:02.990
Nice to meet you. I'm Hijiri's father.

23:39.730 --> 23:42.100
Nee-sama, Santa's red, right?

23:42.100 --> 23:43.270
Are there Santas in other colors?

23:43.270 --> 23:46.520
What are you talking about? Santa equals red.

23:46.520 --> 23:48.440
Are you sure? Is there really not a chance?

